    "name": "Battlers Of Ekrasys",
    "steam_appid": 3612740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battlers Of Ekrasys</strong><br>A deep, text-based autobattler RPG where strategy meets endless progression! Fight, Loot, Craft new spells and jewels, and master the art of the Smithmagic using a runes system !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I\u2019m passionate about theorycrafting\u2014if you are too, you\u2019re going to love this!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is really grindy and idle based !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 How Does It Work?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose <strong>5 spells</strong> from your collection \u2013 they will cycle endlessly in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters, <strong>earn loot</strong>, and instantly face new foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>X waves</strong>, a <strong>boss</strong> appears \u2013 test your build\u2019s strength!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn <strong>new spells</strong> from fallen monsters and expand your arsenal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Deep Crafting &amp; Customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experiment</strong> by fusing spells to create a mix of those spells.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> powerful jewels with randomly generated prefixes &amp; suffixes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Smithmagic</strong> to modify your gear \u2013 upgrade and optimize your stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot</strong> materials to craft new items and improve your build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Progression That Never Stops</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>XP &amp; level up</strong> to unlock stronger spells, and stronger resources for your craft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats, master resistances, and break through <strong>wave after wave</strong> of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different <strong>spell synergies and item builds</strong> to dominate the battlefield!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Minimalist, Engaging Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure text-based combat</strong> with a <strong>clean UI</strong> and deep strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle mechanics allow you to <strong>progress even when AFK</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Ready to Begin Your Journey?<br>Add Battlers Of Ekrasys to your wishlist and prepare to dive into an <strong>infinite RPG adventure</strong> unlike any other!</p>",
