bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>XP &amp; level up</strong> to unlock stronger spells, and stronger resources for your craft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats, master resistances, and break through <strong>wave after wave</strong> of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different <strong>spell synergies and item builds</strong> to dominate the battlefield!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Minimalist, Engaging Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure text-based combat</strong> with a <strong>clean UI</strong> and deep strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle mechanics allow you to <strong>progress even when AFK</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Ready to Begin Your Journey?<br>Add Battlers Of Ekrasys to your wishlist and prepare to dive into an <strong>infinite RPG adventure</strong> unlike any other!</p>",
